{"id":"wb-7-1233","name":"绣衣坊（含范氏家庙和中丞公祠）","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"绣衣坊","text":"汝城绣衣坊位于湖南省汝城县卢阳镇益道村三拱门范家村口，建于明正德十四年（1519年），为表彰监察御史范辂而建。2006年5月被列为湖南省级文物保护单位。2013年，绣衣坊（含范氏家庙和中丞公祠）被列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n绣衣坊是湖南省石牌坊建造时代最早的一座，被誉为“湖南第一坊”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BB%A3%E8%A1%A3%E5%9D%8A","revisionId":95029972,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95029972","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/27ab1601b9a31f245c016a50.jpg","title":"绣衣坊西_20240217.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BB%A3%E8%A1%A3%E5%9D%8A%E8%A5%BF_20240217.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8b/%E7%BB%A3%E8%A1%A3%E5%9D%8A%E8%A5%BF_20240217.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Uuongkinghe","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​绣衣坊西面","width":320,"height":240}}